  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of water to a boil and reduce heat to a simmer.",
    "Place a steamer basket over the pot and add the corn tortillas.",
    "Steam the tortillas for 30 seconds to warm and soften them.",
    "Meanwhile, slice the burrata cheese into small pieces.",
    "Assemble the tacos by placing a piece of cheese onto a warmed tortilla.",
    "Top the cheese with steamed corn, black beans, diced tomatoes, and chopped cilantro.",
    "Drizzle the tacos with lime juice and sprinkle with salt.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "For vegan option, replace burrata cheese with a vegan alternative and proceed with the recipe."
